- You need to enable the “Background Modes” capability in your Xcode project (and configured via `config.xml` for Cordova apps) to allow background audio.
- You also need to set the appropriate media session or AVAudioSession in native code or via plugins to keep audio running in the background.

**Recommended approach:**
